\par\par \b \uc2 Thai Ctrl Bk Chief Denies  \highlight22\uc2 FX Intervention \highlight\uc2  Cost $3 Bln  \b0\par\par\uc2 271 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Dezember 2004\par 07:59\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Pridiyathorn Devakula Tuesday denied that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had bought as much as $3 billion since mid-October to stem the Thai baht's rally.  \par \par \uc2 "We didn't buy $3 billion. That's too much," Pridiyathorn told reporters.  \par \par \uc2 Prime Minister Thaksin Shinawatra said earlier Tuesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought about $3 billion worth of dollars in recent days, without specifying an exact timeframe.  \par \par \uc2 Matichon newspaper reported Tuesday, citing a source from the Bank of Thailand, that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move to sell baht for dollars has resulted in flush liquidity in the financial system.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar buying added around THB120 billion in baht liquidity in the domestic financial market, some of which moved into the local stock market for speculative purposes, the paper said, quoting the source.  \par \par \uc2 "(When the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buys dollars) we always sponge up excess liquidity from the market. We won't let flush liquidity get too high," Pridiyathorn said.  \par \par \uc2 However, he acknowledged that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has managed the baht in recent weeks in a bid to mitigate its pace of appreciation.  \par \par \uc2 Thailand's foreign reserves rose $3.1 billion from Oct. 15 to $48.1 billion as of Nov. 26. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said much of that was due to the appreciation in dollar terms of other foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  held in reserves.  \par \par \uc2 The baht has risen around 4.6% since early November.  \par \par \uc2 -By Bangkok Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266-0744; djnews.bangkok@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Lena Lee [ 07-12-04 0659GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020041207e0c70007u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
