ost major poultry buyers are still banning the import of raw poultry meat from Thailand while allowing the import of cooked products.  \par \par \uc2 Given the limited impact on exports, Pridiyathorn said he also doesn't expect the reemergence of bird flu to have any significant negative effect on domestic consumption.  \par \par \uc2 Thailand confirmed Wednesday fresh outbreaks of the disease in the central provinces of Ayudhya and Prathum Thani. Authorities are culling thousands of chickens in two "red zones" around affected farms.  \par \par \uc2 -By Bangkok Bureau; Dow Jones Newswires; 662 266 0744; djnews.bangkok@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Mary de Wet [ 08-07-04 0611GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040708e0780004p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
