\par\par \b \uc2 Thai Ctrl Bk Is Monitoring THB Strengthening-Official  \b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Februar 2004\par 06:26\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--The Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Thursday that it is closely monitoring the strengthening of the baht against the dollar, but added that, so far, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been in line with the region's \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Tasna Rajatabhothi, Bank of Thailand's assistant governor for financial markets \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said the baht has risen in line with the general dollar weakness, following comments overnight by U.S. Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan.  \par \par \uc2 The chairman said the Fed is in no hurry to lift interest rates from their 45-year lows, despite a more upbeat assessment of economic growth, as inflation remains under control.  \par \par \uc2 "The baht movement is volatile following the Fed's comment on the U.S. economy. However, we're monitoring it," Tasna told reporters.  \par \par \uc2 The current volatility was also related to a joint statement issued by the Group of Seven finance chiefs last weekend, who called for greater flexibility in exchange rates, and to a response from China reiterating that it would be gradually allowing more channels for capital flows while maintaining exchange rate stability, she said.  \par \par \uc2 At 0540 GMT, the dollar was quoted at 38.865 baht, down from THB38.965 at Wednesday's Asian close.  \par \par \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a policy of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem daily volatility and build foreign reserves. Its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are often effective because its restrictions on the movement of baht between onshore and offshore markets has sharply limited speculative trading volumes.  \par \par \uc2 -By Bangkok Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266-0744; djnews.bangkok@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Ryan Woo  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040212e02c00055\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
