\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Slow baht rise won't hurt 04 growth-Thai minister.  \b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Oktober 2003\par 07:28\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BANGKOK, Oct 2 (Reuters) - A gradual strengthening of the baht will not hurt Thailand's gross domestic product growth next year, Finance Minister Suchart Jaovisidha said on Thursday. "If the baht continues to rise slowly, I don't see any down side of that," Suchart told reporters when asked if the rising baht would hurt exports and economic growth next year.  \par \par \uc2 "But if it jumped abruptly to 37 or 38 per dollar, we would be in trouble, he said.  \par \par \uc2 The baht, Asia's best performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has appreciated around nine percent against the dollar so far this year. By 0511 GMT, the baht was traded at 39.50/39.62, up from its Wednesday close of 39.83  \par \par \uc2 The baht has risen since the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Wednesday it was at an appropriate level, not threatening exports and the bank had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop its rise.  \par \par \uc2 Commerce Minister Adisai Bodharamik also said on Wednesday that even if the baht strengthened to 38-39 per dollar by next year, exports would still be competitive.  \par \par \uc2 Bank of Thailand Governor Pridiyathorn Devakula insisted on Thursday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not need to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the baht since it rose "only slightly".  \par \par \uc2 "There is no need to take care of the baht now. It rose only slightly," he told reporters when asked if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  needed to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Late on Thursday morning, Moody's Investor Services placed \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ratings on review for possible upgrade, citing the strength of the economy.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031002dza2001ey\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
