\par\par \b \uc2  Thai  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  easing curbs baht  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  pressure. \b0\par\par\uc2 258 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 August 2003\par 13:53\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Aug 21 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday its additional easing on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls this week should reduce the cost of its efforts to slow the baht's gains through market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Deputy \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Thirachai Phuvanatnaranubala said the Bank of Thailand (BOT) decision to let domestic fund managers invest in more offshore debt instruments abroad was likely to be followed by other central banks in the region. \par \par \uc2  "I think this is a trend to be seen in Asia as it reduces the burden for a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars in the market which go into national reserves," he told reporters. \par \par \uc2  "It is now the turn of private investors to buy dollars, thus reducing the burden on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Thirachai said. \par \par \uc2  The BOT on Wednesday raised, to $2.45 billion from $500 million, the combined amount of offshore debt paper Thai funds and institutions can buy abroad. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the announcement was designed to ease upward pressure on the baht, which has risen about 3.6 percent against the dollar so far this year. \par \par \uc2  Thirachai declined to say whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would accept any further demand from Thai fund managers to invest offshore, saying it would need to satisfy itself that any additional approvals would not affect the Thai bond market. \par \par \uc2  Bond dealers said the BOT move sent yields of medium and long-term government bonds up 10-20 basis points on Wednesday. Some expect further yield steepening in the next few days. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030821dz8l00nrv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
