\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk Chief:No Need To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Mkt Now \b0\par\par\uc2 376 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 August 2003\par 08:15\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK -(Dow Jones)- Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Pridiyathorn Devakula said Thursday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  no longer needs to act in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stabilize the baht after its recent easing of restrictions on overseas investment helped balance capital inflows against outflows. \par \par \uc2  "Our recent measures work very well. They sent a clear signal to the market (about the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's intention to stabilize the baht)," Pridiyathorn told reporters. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  late July issued new rules allowing institutions with huge deposits in low-yielding local accounts to seek higher returns in securities markets abroad. \par \par \uc2  The six categories to benefit from the new rules are: life insurance companies, the government pension fund, the social security fund, mutual funds excluding private funds, provident funds and specialized financial institutions. \par \par \uc2  Commercial banks aren't among the eligible institutions but they would also benefit from the tightening of domestic liquidity. \par \par \uc2  Pridiyathorn said capital inflows now "slightly exceed" capital outflows. \par \par \uc2  At 0640 GMT, the U.S. dollar was quoted at 42.01 baht, down from THB42.08 early morning because of profit taking after the U.S. unit failed to rise above the THB42.10 level. \par \par \uc2  Pridiyathorn said investment will pick up when the country's industrial capacity utilization ratio - which measures the level of production capacity used - reaches 75%. Currently, the ratio is about 67%. \par \par \uc2  "It will take more than a year for the utilization rate to go up to that level," he said. \par \par \uc2  But he said he didn't expect capital inflows from new investment to put significant upward pressure on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The Thai economy is going strong with exports and domestic demand acting as the two main engines of growth. \par \par \uc2  In the first half of the year, new loans grew 6% compared with the year-ago period, outpacing growth in deposits, which is a positive sign for the economy, Pridiyathorn said. \par \par \uc2  He added that Tuesday's bomb blast in Jakarta shouldn't have any major impact on Thailand's lucrative tourism industry. \par \par \uc2  "Thailand has no enemies and we are always well-behaved," he said. \par \par \uc2  -By Suttinee Yuvejwattana, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266-0744; suttinee.yuvejwattana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  -Edited by Bernice Tang \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030807dz87000db\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
